e marked.","Direct care follows the DSS rate-setting definition: nursing and nurse-aide salaries, related fringe benefits, and nursing pool (agency) costs. Fringe benefits are not reported by job, so the direct-care share of fringe is allocated in proportion to nursing salaries.","Owner, officer and related-party names, addresses and amounts are shown as written on the report and in CMS ownership data. Addresses may be business or personal addresses as filed.","Being listed as an owner or related party is not an allegation of wrongdoing. Spending figures are not a measure of care quality."],"corrections_notice":"Records come from public state and federal sources. To report an error, email hello@danbeem.xyz."}
